*****************************************************************
* CABSETSX - SECONDARY INDEX OVER THE SETTLEMENT DATABASE       *
* (CABSETDB), KEYED BY SETLXOCN (COUNTERPARTY OCN + SETTLE      *
* PERIOD).  LETS THE NIGHTLY RECONCILIATION AND CABCT06P        *
* PROCESS A COUNTERPARTY'S SETTLEMENTS IN OCN/PERIOD ORDER      *
* INSTEAD OF ROOT LOAD ORDER.  DATASET TELCABS.IMS.SETLSX ON    *
* THE VSAM KSDS GROUP DBDSETX.                                  *
* REVISION HISTORY                                              *
*   V1.00  1995-11-27  L.FENNIMORE INITIAL GEN, PAIRED WITH      *
*                                  CABSETDB V1.02                *
*   V1.01  2009-10-05  D.WASILEWSKI REBUILT AFTER STDISPSW ADDED *
*                                  TO THE ROOT SEGMENT            *
*   V1.02  2016-01-25  M.OYELARAN  RECOMPILE ONLY                 *
*****************************************************************
         PRINT NOGEN
CABSETSX DBD   NAME=CABSETSX,ACCESS=INDEX
*
DATASET  DD1=SETSX1,DEVICE=3390
*
* INDEX SEGMENT.  SETLXOCN IS THE 10-BYTE SEARCH FIELD (OCN +
* PERIOD) SOURCED FROM STOCNPD ON THE SETLSEG ROOT.
*
SEGM     NAME=SETLXSEG,BYTES=18,PARENT=0
LCHILD   NAME=(SETLSEG,CABSETDB),INDEX=SETLXOCN
FIELD    NAME=(SETLXOCN,SEQ,U),BYTES=10,START=1,TYPE=C
*
DBDGEN
FINISH
END
